eversal (`revertLatestConfirmation()`) to safely roll back dispatched trips, restore vehicle seats, and restore passenger statuses.\n   - **One-Click Rush-Hour Simulation**: Instant state seeder for demos.\n\n3. **Multi-Threaded REST API Server ([`main.cpp`](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/cpp-backend/src/main.cpp))**:\n   - Built on `cpp-httplib` with complete CORS support (`Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *`).\n   - Serves 22 production REST endpoints under `/api/` (routes, passengers, priority-lounge, drivers, fleet, trips, audit/rollback, analytics, and demo loader).\n\n4. **Build, Test, and Run Tooling**:\n   - **CMake Build**: [`CMakeLists.txt`](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/cpp-backend/CMakeLists.txt) with automated `FetchContent` for `cpp-httplib` and `nlohmann/json`.\n   - **Windows Scripts**: [`build.bat`](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/cpp-backend/build.bat) & [`run.bat`](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/cpp-backend/run.bat).\n   - **Test Suites**: [`test_api.ps1`](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/cpp-backend/test_api.ps1) (PowerShell) and [`test_api.sh`](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/cpp-backend/test_api.sh) (Bash curl).\n   - **Documentation**: [`README.md`](file:///C:/Users/Kartik%20Bhosle/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6976d1a8-fd03-4453-a790-acd552e1861a/cpp-backend/README.md).\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Quick Start Instructions\n\n#### On Windows:\n```cmd\ncd cpp-backend\nbuild.bat\nrun.bat\n```\n\n#### On Linux / macOS:\n```bash\ncd cpp-backend\nmkdir build && cd build\ncmake ..\ncmake --build . --config Release\n./nexus_backend\n```\n\n#### Running Automated API Tests:\n```powershell\n#